<沿革內容><![CDATA[1. Promulgated on December 12, 2001
2. Amendment to 22 articles in all and promulgated on February 10, 2004.
3. Amendment to Article 17 per the National Archives Administration Decree No. Tang-Dian 09400029461 dated July8, 2005.
